      "content": "wait i thought vitamin k was supposed to help with blood clotting? if i'm taking a bunch of it for my bones, wouldn't that just make the warfarin work better or something? i dont really want to go back to the doctor and bother them just for a supplement question if it's not a big deal. is it really that risky?",
